<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{with index .Data "company_name"}}<strong>{{.}}</strong>{{else}}A company{{end}} would like to get in touch with you on Koro. See the request and accept it within 14 days, or decline it without giving a reason. If you accept, the company can see your profile; a decline is never explained to the company.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{index .Data "url"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">See the request</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#52525b;font-size:13px;">The request's subject and message are shown on Koro only. You can turn these notifications off per channel in your notification preferences (contact requests).</p>
